In the game a road gives no gain: you move as fast and tire as quickly as on grass or in the forest. With this mod a road is worth the detour.

[size=4][b]Main features[/b][/size]
[list]
[*][b]Faster on roads.[/b] You move 33% faster on a road, walking or running.[/*]
[*][b]Less stamina drain.[/b] Moving on a road drains half the stamina, so you can run about twice as long.[/*]
[*][b]Road buff.[/b] A green buff tile shows with your status effects while you are on a road. Hover over it to see the boost.[/*]
[*][b]Save safety.[/b] The mod writes nothing to your save, so you can remove it at any time. Made for single player: co-op is not tested.[/*]
[/list]

[size=4][b]Requirements[/b][/size]
[list]
[*]The Last Plague: Blight 0.12.7 or later.[/*]
[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/thelastplagueblight/mods/9]BepInEx for The Last Plague: Blight[/url].[/*]
[/list]

[size=4][b]Installation[/b][/size]
[list=1]
[*]Install [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/thelastplagueblight/mods/9]BepInEx[/url].[/*]
[*]Extract this mod's zip into the game folder (the folder with the game .exe). The DLL lands in BepInEx\plugins. Full path example:
[code]C:\Program Files (x86)\Steam\steamapps\common\The Last Plague\BepInEx\plugins\FasterRoads.dll[/code][/*][/list]

[size=4][b]Uninstall[/b][/size]
Delete [font=Courier New]FasterRoads.dll[/font] from the [font=Courier New]BepInEx\plugins[/font] folder.

[size=4][b]Configuration[/b][/size]
To change mod settings, edit [font=Courier New]BepInEx\config\com.ivmakk.thelastplagueblight.fasterroads.cfg[/font] while the game is closed (see [url=https://github.com/ivmakk-tlpb/tlpb-faster-roads/blob/main/CONFIG.md]CONFIG.md[/url] for every setting). Changes apply at the next game start.

[size=4][b]Source and license[/b][/size]
